Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《马斯格雷夫礼典》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:26.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多好的天气啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splendid air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:28.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打场猎？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rough shooting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.88,0:03:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者再钓会鱼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps a little fishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有萨塞克斯郡最棒的厨师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the best cook in the county of Sussex{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.62,0:03:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wouldn't you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:41.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有雷金纳德·马斯格雷夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Reginald Musgrave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.47,0:03:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是英国最古老的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well he is a sign{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.83,0:03:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个家族的后裔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of one of the oldest families in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是我的大学同学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in the same college as myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:47.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在同学中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was not generally popular{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不太受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}among the undergraduates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我总认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he always seemed to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他表现出的那种傲慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that what was set down as pride,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:53.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是为了掩饰他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was really a cover for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天生羞怯的表现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}extreme natural diffidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每当我想起他那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed I never think of his{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苍白 瘦削的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pale,lean face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及头部的姿态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the poise of his head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:04.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脑海里总会浮现灰色的拱道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without associating him with gray archways,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直棂窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mullioned windows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:09.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一堆封建古堡的颓垣败瓦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all the venerable wreckage of a feudal keep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:11.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然你诸多不满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well if you feel so uncharitable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:13.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么还要接受他的邀请？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why didn't you accept his invitation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想逃离死气沉沉的气氛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To escape my lethargy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.91,0:04:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有你对打扫贝克街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're constant bullying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那房子的孜孜不倦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to tidy our room in Baker Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.60,0:04:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有孜孜不倦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardly constant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:24.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我打算用整个周末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I have decided to devote my weekend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:30.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来整理我早期的案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the collating of some of my early works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么早期的案件？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What early works?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.33,0:04:33.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我的传记作家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was before my biographer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:35.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来颂扬我之前的案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}came to glorify me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:37.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说你有早期案件的记录？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mean you have records of your work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:38.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是都是成功的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all successes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:41.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但也有个别迷人的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But some pretty little problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}塔尔顿凶杀案的记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Record of the Tarleton murders,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:46.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}范贝里酒商案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the case of Vamberry,the wine merchant,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.77,0:04:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}俄罗斯老妇历险记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the adventure of the old Russian woman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.96,0:04:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}畸足人里科里特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a full account of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:52.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和他那可恶妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ricoletti with the clubfoot,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.41,0:04:54.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}案件的详细记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his abominable wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:59.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有铝制拐杖案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the singular affair of the aluminum crutch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.15,0:05:01.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}铝制拐杖？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aluminum crutch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那东西有点过分讲究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that was something a little recherché?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.78,0:05:13.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望我也有这些案子的笔记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I had notes of these cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:16.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想得倒美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随房主参观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you may hold my interest for a few hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}古董历史长廊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you potter with our host{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许能让我感兴趣个几个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through the antiquities of a by gone age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.45,0:05:27.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房子能让你感兴趣吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely the house interests you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.82,0:05:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那房子冷极了 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The house is freezing Watson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:33.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:35.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房子里的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得你说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your previous visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.07,0:05:39.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你上次拜访时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember you telling me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:42.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和一名男管家有许多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you endured some lively conversations{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.33,0:05:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}精彩的对话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a butler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:45.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他叫布兰斯顿吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's his name Brunston?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:48.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 布兰斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Brunton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:51.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一名当起了管家的年轻教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A young schoolteacher out of place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:54.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是不是… 是不是会几国语言？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he not... did he not speak several languages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 还会弹奏几乎所有乐器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,he played nearly every musical instrument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位远比其主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man of considerably{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:06:01.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要聪明的男士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more intellectual ability than his master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.59,0:06:08.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 我们要得体一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson we must behave ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe,Brunton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 很高兴能再次见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes,a pleasure to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:16.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的朋友兼同事 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend and colleague,Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎来到赫尔斯通 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Hurlstone,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:20.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马斯格雷夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Musgrave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的朋友兼同事 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my friend and colleague,Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:24.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}见到你们真高兴 久别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So glad,it's a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:27.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这段时间过得怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is all gone with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:28.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}忙啊 忙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh busy,busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.91,0:06:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得接手管理这座庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had the estates to manage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:32.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我现在亦是本区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as I am now a member of parliament{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.01,0:06:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}议会的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the district as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你… 似乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you... you I have noticed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:38.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还在将你在大学时让人吃惊的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are still turning to practical end of powers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那套本事运用到现实生活中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with which you used to amaze us at college.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 我还是靠脑子为生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,I'm still living by wits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.23,0:06:44.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女主人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and how is the dear wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:48.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没结婚呢 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not married Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:54.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗户的年代可追朔至1596年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the windows date from 1596.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:56.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这座庄园被认为是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The manor is thought to be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:58.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全国尚有人居住的最古老的庄园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the oldest inhabited building in the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.27,0:07:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道北方也有姓马斯格雷夫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I once knew some northern Musgrave's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:03.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的确来自北方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did come from the north originally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}家族中的一支庶系分支\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cadet branch of the family{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.12,0:07:07.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脱离了北方的马斯格雷夫家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}broke away from the northern Musgrave's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于十七世纪初来到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and came to West Sussex{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}北萨塞克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the early seventeenth century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:18.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再来点白兰地吗 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More brandy sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不了 布兰斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,Brunton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:20.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是事情的经过 兰德尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how the story goes,Randall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:21.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I can vouch for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是委任状在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the commission is over here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.58,0:08:27.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由鲁珀特王子签发的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}signed by Prince Rupert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:30.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从我的祖先拉夫·马斯格雷夫流传下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's from my ancestor the Ralph Musgrave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.14,0:08:33.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在边山拥有一支骑兵连\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,enjoy is cavalry troop at Edge Hill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:37.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鲁珀特的封印章和委任书 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rupert's seal and commissioned Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.52,0:08:40.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太让人吃惊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Astonishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.65,0:08:43.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是那天穿的靴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of the boots worn that day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恕我无礼 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I may be so bold sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.80,0:08:47.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:49.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这对靴子是他哥哥穿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boot was worn by his brother,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗兰·马斯格雷夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Roland Musgrave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.75,0:08:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实际上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was indeed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:09:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的管家曾是一名教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my butler was once a schoolmaster,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:02.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的学识以及对我家族史的了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must bow to his scholarship over mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:05.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都远在我之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and matters of my own family's history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no never mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.60,0:09:12.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you may leave us now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.23,0:09:18.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对了 布兰斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah but Brunton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:20.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋今晚去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where is Rachel tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.79,0:09:22.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她发低烧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has a slightest temperature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我让她回房间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told her to go to her room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.74,0:09:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night,gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:10:01.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯… 福尔摩斯跟我说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes... Holmes has told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:04.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿的奇思妙想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Brunton's extraordinary idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得上一次拜访的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I remember on my last visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他花了几个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he spent several hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:12.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用法语给我讲述\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}explaining to me in French{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}短笛的起源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the origins of the piccolo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他满足于这个职位如此之久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is wonderful that he should be satisfied{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:24.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实在太让人惊讶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for so long with such a position{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.21,0:10:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I suppose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.71,0:10:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他过得太安逸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose he's been comfortable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:31.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也就不思进取了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lacked the energy to make a change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.27,0:10:33.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes,indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:36.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赫尔斯通的男管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The butler of Hurlstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:37.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总让来访的宾客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's always a thing that is remembered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.99,0:10:39.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}印象深刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by all who visit us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:42.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的马斯格雷夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh dear Musgrave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 这个完人有一个缺点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,this paragon does have one fault,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:49.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有点唐璜(玩弄女性的荒淫贵族)的风格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a bit of a Don Juan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在安静的乡村扮演这样的角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it's not a difficult part to play{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.03,0:10:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可没有难度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in quiet country district.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他结婚的时候 尚算检点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he was married he was all right,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但成了鳏夫以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but since he's become a widower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就麻烦不断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've had no end of trouble with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:10:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几个月前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,a few months ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.81,0:11:00.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他终于有安定下来的希望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we were in hopes he was about to settle down again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.73,0:11:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他和瑞秋·豪威尔订婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He became engaged to Rachel Howells,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:03.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的第二任女仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my second housemaid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.75,0:11:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他把她抛弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he has thrown her over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和珍妮·特雷杰丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taken up with Janet Tregallis,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:08.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}猎场看守人的女儿好上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my gamekeeper's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:10.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋是个好女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel is a very good girl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但她有着威尔士人的那种易激动的脾气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she is of an excitable Welsh temperament.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在她像个鬼魂似的到处游荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now she wonders around like a black-eyed shadow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.60,0:11:21.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}害得上上下下都闷闷不乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thoroughly unsettling the household.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.62,0:11:58.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上好 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning,Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:11:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雷金纳德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Reginald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.74,0:12:19.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Brunton this morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.95,0:12:29.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事 没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right,it's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:30.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.71,0:12:32.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:34.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她要晕过去了 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl is fainting,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}年轻的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear young woman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:42.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不该干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you should not be at work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:44.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而该待在床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you should be in bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以请假 瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may leave your duties,Rachel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:48.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感觉好些了再回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back when you're feeling stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:50.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am strong enough,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这由我说得算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be the judge of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.93,0:12:53.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你得回房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must go to your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:54.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}躺下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.72,0:12:57.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回房的时候告诉布兰斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on your way tell Brunton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:12:59.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I wish to see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:02.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}管家走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The butler is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:03.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:05.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.08,0:13:06.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.51,0:13:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现在不在房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not in his room now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有人见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one's seen him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:12.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 没错 他走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yes,yes,he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.43,0:13:24.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.11,0:13:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}轻轻地 轻点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gently.Gentle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:39.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放轻松 瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gently Rachel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:39.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放轻松 瑞秋 放轻松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gently,Rachel,gently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.06,0:13:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}轻点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.06,0:14:08.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}床没有睡过的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bed's not been slept in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你找过房子的其他地方么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you searched the house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.51,0:14:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从顶楼到地窖都找过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From cellar to garret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那女孩说得没错 没有他的踪影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The girl's right there's no trace of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.39,0:14:14.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不知道他怎么出去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not see how the man could have left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.66,0:14:19.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗户和门都锁着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean the windows and door are all fastened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:21.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么一个人大半夜出走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What man goes away in the middle of the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:22.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却什么都没带？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and leaves all his possessions behind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.65,0:14:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没带钱 怀表？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And money,watch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:25.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经让那女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I've given the girl{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:27.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}平复下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something to calm her down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且自作主张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've taken the liberty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请了位本地护士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to sending for a local nurse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:33.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她现在精神极度紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's in a most unusual nervous state.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她绝对不适宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she should,on no account,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}独自呆着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be left alone for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.80,0:14:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她就是和布兰斯顿订婚的女孩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the girl who was engaged to Brunton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:40.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋·豪威尔 是的 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel Howells,yes,yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有着威尔士人脾气的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Girl with a fine Welsh temper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:46.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}各位 我无意让如此琐碎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look gentlemen I had no intention of this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.13,0:14:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}家庭小事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}small domestic incident{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}破坏你们的周末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should ruin your weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.57,0:14:52.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我提议依计划去打猎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I propose we continue our plans for a shoot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望回来的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll return hopefully{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:56.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能有答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to some simple explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.45,0:15:32.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干的好 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:46.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:48.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如我跟华生所说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I was telling Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:52.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨晚发生了一些事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something happened last night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.36,0:15:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许能为这件事提供点线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which may throw some light on this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.77,0:15:59.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说很丢脸 但…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is very embarrassing but I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:03.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要你的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I find I need your advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:07.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚饭后不明智地喝了杯咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't sleep after foolishly taking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:08.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}导致我睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that cup of Coffee after dinner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大约两点的时候 我放弃了尝试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and about two o'clock I gave up the struggle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:13.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去楼下图书馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came downstairs to fetch a novel I'm reading,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:15.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿我在读的一本小说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which I'd left in the library.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:16.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能想象我有多惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you can imagine my surprise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我看到门开着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I saw a glimmer of light{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:21.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里面透出灯光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coming from the open door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:23.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得我们离开前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd remembered I had extinguished the lamp{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.81,0:16:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经熄了灯关了门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and closed the door when we retired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自然而然我就想到盗窃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naturally my first thought was burglars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:12.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是你回报我的信任的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is how you repay my trust,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:16.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窥探我的家族资料？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}prying into my family documents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:19.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天马上离职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will leave my service tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马斯格雷夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Musgrave,sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想带着耻辱离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't be a disgrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直都为自己的地位自豪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always been proud about my station in life,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:09.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}耻辱会让我生不如死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and disgrace would kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.88,0:18:12.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你把我逼上绝路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My blood will be on your head sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:16.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的手上就会沾满我的鲜血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it will indeed if you drive me to despair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.21,0:18:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:19.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我不能保住工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you cannot keep me after this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那看在上帝的份上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then for God sake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:22.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我向你辞职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let me give you notice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.47,0:18:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在一个月内离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and leave in a month{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:25.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当作是我自己的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as of my own free will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个月太长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A month is too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.31,0:18:29.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以忍受 马斯格雷夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could stand that,Mr. Musgrave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:31.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要不是当着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not to be cast out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:33.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认识的人面前被赶走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before all the folk I know so well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不配这种照顾 布兰斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't deserve consideration,Brunton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:39.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经声名狼藉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your conduct has been infamous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.25,0:18:42.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然尔 我无意让你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,I've no wish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:44.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当众受辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bring public disgrace upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.67,0:18:46.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个星期内自行离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take yourself away in a week,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论你用什么理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you give whatever reason you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:50.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个星期 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A week,sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:53.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一个星期？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a week?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两周 起码两周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fortnight-say at least a fortnight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 一个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No a week!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:18:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you may consider yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.87,0:19:02.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这已经是宽大处理了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have been very leniently dealt with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.26,0:19:10.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奇怪之处在于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what is strange{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:13.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他似乎非常紧张能否久留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that he seemed most anxious to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:15.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后的事情就显而易见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it's quite plain to me what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:17.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他回到房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went back to his room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.61,0:19:19.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深思熟虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thought it over,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.35,0:19:21.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}决定立刻消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}decided to stage his disappearance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.19,0:19:23.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常明智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there and then cleverly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.11,0:19:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许在新女朋友的帮助下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possibly with the help of his new woman friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.47,0:19:26.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}珍妮？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她和她父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She lives with her father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住在湖对岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the other side of the lake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.97,0:19:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且 我怀疑她是否有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and besides I doubt if she'd have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:34.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帮助他的本事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the wit to help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:37.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这张纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This piece of paper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿认为值得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which Brunton thought worth his while to consult,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.81,0:19:42.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冒失去工作的危险一读\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even at the risk of the losing his job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.90,0:19:44.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:47.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么重要的信息也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing of any importance at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.45,0:19:53.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevertheless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.69,0:19:59.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这只是份古老奇怪的礼典抄件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's simply a copy of the singular old observance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.98,0:20:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫做马斯格雷夫礼典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}called the Musgrave Ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的家族对此毫不陌生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seldom peculiar to our family,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每个马斯格雷夫家族成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which each Musgrave has to go through{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}成年时都需要接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he's coming of age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是份奇怪的教义问答集\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a strange catechism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:17.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有日期 但却使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Undated but written in the style{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.20,0:20:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十七世纪中叶的风格拼写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the middle of the seventeenth century.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:20.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和华生能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you and Watson be good enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.61,0:20:22.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我读一下吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to read it out to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.21,0:20:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生 我已经烂熟于心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Doctor,I know it by heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:29.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它是谁的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:31.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个离开的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His who is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.36,0:20:33.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁应拥有它？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who shall have it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.45,0:20:34.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个将到来的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He who will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:36.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太阳于何处？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was the sun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.89,0:20:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}橡树之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the oak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.21,0:20:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}影子于何处？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was the shadow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.02,0:20:41.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}榆树之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under the elm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如何测量？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was it stepped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.37,0:20:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向西八步乘八步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}West eight by eight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向南七步乘七步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}south seven by seven,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.96,0:20:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向西六步乘六步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}west six by six,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.05,0:20:54.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向南五步乘五步 两步乘两步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}south five by five and two by two,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.88,0:20:56.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于此下方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and so under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用何物换取？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What shall we give for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倾吾所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that is ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:03.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为何换取？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should we give it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.71,0:21:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为守信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the sake of the trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.74,0:21:12.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个寻宝迷题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why,it's a treasure hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.76,0:21:16.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 我记得小时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no,no,I remember as children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们总想破解它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we often tried to solve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.73,0:21:19.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总是徒劳无功\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It leads nowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.23,0:21:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿以前看过这份东西吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could Brunston have seen this before last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.53,0:21:24.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:26.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们从不费心藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took no pains to hide it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.15,0:21:27.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他要来有什么用呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what could he want with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:32.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明显是想加深记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously he was refreshing his memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.31,0:21:35.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说你进去时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say that he had some map or chart,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.75,0:21:37.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他正把某些地图或图表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which he was thrust back into his pocket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:38.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}往口袋里塞？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the moment you appeared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.99,0:21:40.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what it looked like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.95,0:21:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须再次研究这份礼典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must reexamine this ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些数据明显是指向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The measurements obviously refer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某一特定地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to some exact spot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.06,0:21:49.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}礼典的其余部分没有明确指明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to which the rest of the document eludes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:51.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有两个提示？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are given two guides?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.03,0:21:56.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 榆树和橡树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,an elm and an oak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:22:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 橡树中有棵树王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And gentlemen,there is a patriarch among oaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝对是庄园内最古老的橡树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly the oldest oak on the estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这棵树肯定在诺曼底人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This tree must have been here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}征服英国时就存在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the time of the Norman Conquest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In all probability{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.10,0:22:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.59,0:22:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不可能是礼典中的橡树 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it can't be the oak referred to,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:19.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}历代的马斯格雷夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Generations of Musgrave's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都尝试破解这礼典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have attempted to solve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.66,0:22:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一半的地都被挖过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've dug up half this field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.67,0:22:34.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说得对 马斯格雷夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are right,Musgrave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.27,0:22:38.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是礼典中的橡树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is not the oak referred to in the ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这附近还有没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there any other large oaks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:41.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别的大橡树？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the immediate vicinity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.99,0:22:47.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}房子一英里内没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not within a mile of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.17,0:22:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太阳于何处？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was the sun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}橡树之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the oak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.15,0:22:54.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你今天什么也做不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can make nothing of it today,old man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.82,0:22:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天气变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the weather's turned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.05,0:24:54.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}理查德先生 早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Richard. Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.55,0:25:01.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这有八英尺深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's eight foot deep here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.21,0:25:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的疯女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor demented girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.29,0:25:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must live and hope,old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.79,0:25:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尸体还没找到呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been no body found yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.74,0:25:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一无所获 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing so far sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.58,0:25:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都快捞遍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've just about covered all of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.36,0:25:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里有发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.74,0:25:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里面有什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it contain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.26,0:25:59.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无价值的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing of value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.39,0:26:01.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}任何人任何时候能抛这么个袋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could have been thrown in by anyone at anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.34,0:26:03.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是最近扔的 否则水早就把它腐蚀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No recently or the water would have rotted the bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.52,0:26:06.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女仆昨晚抛的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The maid last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:10.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这能表明她来过湖边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it would explain her journey to the mere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.69,0:26:14.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但接着又去哪了呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but then where did she go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.76,0:26:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里啥都没有 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing here,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.06,0:26:24.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是一堆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a mass of,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.76,0:26:30.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生锈褪色的金属和鹅卵石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rusted and discolored metal and some pebbles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.15,0:26:32.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而布兰斯顿和瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where is Brunton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.20,0:26:33.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or Rachel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.80,0:26:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么有人会费神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should anybody bother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.57,0:26:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把这些东西扔进湖里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to throw this into the lake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.96,0:26:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am convinced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.38,0:26:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有三个谜团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that there are not three mysteries here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.85,0:26:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but only one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.13,0:26:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要解开一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the solution of one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.80,0:26:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就能顺藤摸瓜 解决其余的谜团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may prove the solutions to the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.65,0:26:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿肯定在这里发现什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently Brunton saw something in this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.42,0:26:58.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而你未能发现 马斯格雷夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which escaped your forbears,Musgrave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.13,0:27:00.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他希望能从中得利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from which he expected some personal advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.78,0:27:03.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我没推测错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can read it right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.04,0:27:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我手中掌握着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hold in my hand the clue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.76,0:27:10.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于管家布兰斯顿和女仆瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the truth concerning both the butler Brunton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.44,0:27:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事情真相的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the maid Howells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.50,0:27:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太阳于何处？橡树之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever is the sun over the oak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.14,0:27:19.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}影子于何处？榆树之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where was the shadow on the elm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.68,0:27:28.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是榆树生长的位置？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is where it grew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.97,0:27:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.60,0:27:31.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想已经不可能告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose it's impossible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.99,0:27:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}树的高度了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to tell me how high it was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.59,0:27:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我立马就能告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can give you that at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.19,0:27:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}六十四英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was sixty-four feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.77,0:27:40.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以前的家庭教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my old tutor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.58,0:27:42.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教我学三角学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used to give me lessons in trigonometry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.31,0:27:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我小时候就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a lad I used to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.63,0:27:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庄园内每棵树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the height of every tree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.03,0:27:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每座建筑的高度了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and building on this estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.08,0:27:50.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很感激你的家庭教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am grateful to your tutor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.97,0:27:53.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿曾经在这个草坪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me did Brunton ever ask you such a question{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.82,0:27:58.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问过同样的问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here on this lawn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.10,0:28:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你让我想起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that you call it to my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.62,0:28:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brunton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.32,0:28:25.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在这做什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.90,0:28:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}享受美好的夜晚 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoying the evening,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.89,0:28:32.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的私人草坪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my private lawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.37,0:28:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅我请教一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pardon me for asking sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.45,0:28:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾经在这里的那棵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the elm that once stood here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.05,0:28:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被雷击中的榆树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was struck by lightning,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.93,0:28:39.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经不记得有多高了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you wouldn't remember the height of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.50,0:28:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.14,0:28:44.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么想知道这个呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well why should you want to know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.85,0:28:47.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和特雷杰丽丝先生在争论呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I'm arguing with Mr. Tregallis about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.39,0:28:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说是五十英尺高 他说不止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say it was fifty feet,he put it higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.34,0:28:52.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们打了个小赌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a small wager on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.84,0:28:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你得输了 布兰斯顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,well you've lost your wager,Brunton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.73,0:28:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是六十四英尺高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was sixty-four feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.47,0:29:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe,was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.39,0:29:03.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还是大方点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall just have to be a good sport{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.38,0:29:05.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿赌服输吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and pay up then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.50,0:29:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.12,0:29:37.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.65,0:29:41.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.61,0:29:44.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh good lord!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.36,0:29:46.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在必须找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we must find where{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.24,0:29:48.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当太阳偏离橡树时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the shadow of the elm would have fallen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.32,0:29:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}榆树的影子会落到哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the sun is just clear of that oak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.24,0:29:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那很有难度 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that'll be difficult,Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.01,0:29:54.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为榆树已经没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since the elm's no longer there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.75,0:29:56.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来吧 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh now come,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.35,0:29:59.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果布兰斯顿能做到 我们也能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Brunton can do it then so can we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.37,0:30:02.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}答案就在三角学中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer lies in trigonometry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.95,0:30:05.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马斯格雷夫 我需要庄园里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Musgrave I need all the fishing rods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.56,0:30:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有鱼竿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you have in the hall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.77,0:30:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.09,0:30:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.83,0:30:54.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我… 我不太明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I don't quite follow this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.33,0:30:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe splendid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.89,0:31:01.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马斯格雷夫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Musgrave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.66,0:31:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庄园里所有的鱼竿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every rod in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.59,0:31:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.02,0:31:22.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请把尺子给我 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Measuring stick please,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.82,0:31:31.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请帮我拿着好吗 马斯格雷夫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you hold that for me,Musgrave please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.49,0:31:32.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有那个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.84,0:31:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在将绳子一端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now will you take the last yard of the string{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.10,0:31:37.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绑在鱼竿底部 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tie it to the base of the fishing rod,Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.06,0:31:40.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.25,0:31:41.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完成以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when you've done that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.71,0:31:43.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带着礼典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you bring the Ritual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.41,0:31:45.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来草坪找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and join me on the lawn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.23,0:32:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请量一下那个影子好吗 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you measure that shadow,please Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.62,0:32:24.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}九英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.33,0:32:25.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这一来就很容易计算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the calculation is now a simple one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果鱼竿是六英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If a fishing rod of six feet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.73,0:32:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}投下个影子是九英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throws a shadow of nine feet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:30.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}榆树高六十四英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then a tree of sixty-four feet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.72,0:32:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那影子是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would throw one of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.87,0:32:32.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}九十八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ninety-eight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.95,0:32:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}九十六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ninety-six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.80,0:32:38.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两者肯定在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the line of one of course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.54,0:32:40.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同一直线上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would be the line of the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.32,0:33:04.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.09,0:33:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}距离我的记号两英寸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two inches from mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.46,0:33:08.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿作的记号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mark made by Brunton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.44,0:33:10.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把步数念给我听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now read out the steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.52,0:33:13.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向西八步乘八步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}West eight by eight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.55,0:33:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}六十四步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixty-four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.08,0:33:42.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向南七步乘七步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then south seven by seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.11,0:33:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}四十九步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forty-nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.43,0:33:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.64,0:33:54.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}六步乘六步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six by six.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.42,0:34:00.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三十六步 然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty-six and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.05,0:34:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向南五步乘五步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South Five by five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.53,0:34:44.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.78,0:34:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两步乘两步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two by Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.97,0:34:51.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一 二 三 四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One,two,three,four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.21,0:34:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.74,0:34:57.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你计算有误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some mistake in your calculations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.94,0:34:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.27,0:35:07.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿还没来过这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brunton hasn't been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.36,0:35:11.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两步乘两步 于此下方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two by two and so under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.18,0:35:14.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些石头很多年没有动过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These stones haven't been moved in many a long year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.16,0:35:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于此下方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.08,0:35:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.81,0:35:20.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你忘记了"于此下方"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've forgotten the "and under."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.98,0:35:23.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里有地窖么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a cellar under here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.76,0:35:26.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有 年代和房子一样老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As old as the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.50,0:35:46.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里原本遍地都是木材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been wood all over the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.53,0:35:48.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是布兰斯顿的围巾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Brunton's muffler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.26,0:35:49.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd swear to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.55,0:35:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.04,0:37:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡官 这是我的一位朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector,this is a friend of mine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.85,0:37:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.21,0:37:04.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.53,0:37:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在法医学方面有些许经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some experience in forensic pathology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.03,0:37:09.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这名男子已经死亡两天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man has been dead for two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.15,0:37:11.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窒息死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause of death suffocation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.38,0:37:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有伤口或瘀伤 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wound or bruise on this person,sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.54,0:37:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.33,0:37:19.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}意外 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accident hey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.96,0:37:21.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh there's no doubt about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.63,0:37:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他肯定一个人在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have been down there alone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.30,0:37:27.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}石板就盖上了 可怜的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the flagstone just fell shut on him,poor fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.54,0:37:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}雷金纳德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Reginald,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.86,0:37:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据说您的管家所在的地下室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm told that your butler was down in the cellar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.63,0:37:33.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经废弃不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in an unused part of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.90,0:37:36.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在那里做什么 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was his business there sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.20,0:37:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}管家的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A butler's duties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.76,0:37:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是多样且多变的 巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are many and varied,Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.36,0:37:40.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我无法回答那个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't possibly answer that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.06,0:37:42.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那个地方 没有人能听见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well no one would have heard his cries for help{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.59,0:37:44.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的呼救声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in that part of the house,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.19,0:37:45.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那便是关键 巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is the point surely,Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.54,0:37:59.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷杰丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tregallis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.69,0:38:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.74,0:38:01.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是她干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She done it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.02,0:38:03.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她把他给杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She killed him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.20,0:38:05.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why she ran away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.29,0:38:06.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}特雷杰丽丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tregallis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.61,0:38:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.31,0:38:09.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.74,0:38:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仆人们伤心这很正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The servants are naturally upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.75,0:38:13.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well who is this Rachel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.35,0:38:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的女仆之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of my housemaids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.85,0:38:16.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她和布兰斯顿订婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was engaged to Brunton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.31,0:38:18.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请把他盖上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do please cover him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.53,0:38:19.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一天晚上他失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One evening he disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.99,0:38:21.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她就病恹恹然后离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She became ill and left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.73,0:38:23.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想见见她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I shall want to see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.40,0:38:24.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有刚刚那位年轻女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall want to see that young woman also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.00,0:38:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡佐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.81,0:38:30.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他抬走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right take him away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.21,0:38:32.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生 请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.89,0:38:43.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当地的巡官 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The local inspector Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.53,0:38:45.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你能找到一个解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could find a plausible explanation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.82,0:38:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能避免家丑外扬…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to avoid publicity in this retched...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.65,0:38:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must confess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.84,0:38:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迄今为止 我对自己的调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that so far I am disappointed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.93,0:38:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in my investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.81,0:38:59.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一度认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had reckoned upon solving the matter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.62,0:39:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要来到礼典所指的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when once I'd find the place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.12,0:39:02.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就能解开迷题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}referred to in the Ritual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.54,0:39:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但现在我身在此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but now that I'm here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.18,0:39:06.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍然无法得知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm as far as ever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.02,0:39:08.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你家族如此精心埋藏的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from knowing where it was your family concealed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.83,0:39:11.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}究竟是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with such an elaborate precautions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.58,0:39:13.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你解决了布兰斯顿的迷题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you've solved my mystery of Brunton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.98,0:39:15.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}究竟是怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.85,0:39:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他为什么会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did his fate come upon him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.16,0:39:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及失踪的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what part has been played{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.83,0:39:23.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这其中又扮演了什么角色？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the woman whose disappeared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.70,0:39:33.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要解释一下福尔摩斯的破案方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should explain Holmes methods in such cases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.75,0:39:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他… 他在估量对方的智慧后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He... he puts himself in the man's place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.30,0:39:40.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把自己代入对方的角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}having first gauged his intelligence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.60,0:39:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then he...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.24,0:39:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会想象假如是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he tries to imagine how he himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.43,0:39:46.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在同样的情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would have proceeded{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.20,0:39:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会如何处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in similar circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.53,0:39:50.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案件中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.03,0:39:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布兰斯顿绝顶聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brunton's intelligence is first rate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.23,0:39:55.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此不必担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you see it is unnecessary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.04,0:40:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他观察问题会出现"个人观察容许误差"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make allowance for the personal equation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.30,0:40:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是天文学家的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the astronomers have dubbed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.99,0:40:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他知道有东西被藏起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows something is concealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.98,0:40:43.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他发现了地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has spotted the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.79,0:41:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他发现靠一个人的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has found the stone is too heavy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.64,0:41:34.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难以拉动石板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a man to move unaided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.62,0:41:40.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他该怎么办呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what does he do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.35,0:41:42.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找外人帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help from outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.09,0:41:43.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有人可以信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one to trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.90,0:41:48.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找内部的人帮忙？找谁呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help from inside but who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.52,0:41:51.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.30,0:41:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她还爱着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She still loves him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.94,0:41:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从她的眼里就能看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sees it in her eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.67,0:42:10.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是来道歉的 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to say I'm sorry my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.39,0:42:11.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是个愚蠢的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a foolish man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.95,0:42:13.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我配不上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't deserve you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.44,0:42:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你配不上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.15,0:42:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原谅我 瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me Rachel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.55,0:42:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.39,0:42:21.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有别的人能拥有我的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no one else for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.41,0:42:24.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从没有过 你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one ever has been,you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.46,0:42:28.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个房子在吞噬你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this house it eats into your soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.05,0:42:31.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我带你离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me take you away from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.41,0:42:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll start afresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.92,0:42:35.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your promises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.93,0:42:41.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 理查德 你毫无顾忌和他人发生关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Richard,you make love so freely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.32,0:42:46.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从未爱过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never loved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.36,0:42:48.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh you're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.00,0:42:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我既爱你的美貌 也爱你的内心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you for your beauty and your spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.62,0:42:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是天造地设的一对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a perfect match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.77,0:42:57.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的头脑加上你的心灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With my brains and your heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.69,0:43:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自由在呼唤我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do we want with service to others{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.75,0:43:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么还要为他人服务呢？亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when a world is out there calling us,my love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.74,0:43:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}身无分文怎么生存？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how do we get out there with no money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.08,0:43:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会有钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have all the money we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.52,0:43:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在这所房子里找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found something in this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.47,0:43:14.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有地主都找不到的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all them country squires have missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.00,0:43:17.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我找到了 我们可以离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I've found it and we're ready to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.65,0:43:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和你一起离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not without you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.70,0:43:23.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没了你我无法生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't live without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.45,0:43:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要做你的丈夫 瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm to be your husband,Rachel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.54,0:43:32.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.56,0:43:36.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你找到什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you found?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.31,0:43:38.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.47,0:43:40.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿上衣服 我带你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on your gown,I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.05,0:43:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}轻点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Softly now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.78,0:44:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在这 在石板下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is,under that stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.09,0:44:12.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只需把石板拉起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we have to do is lift it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.00,0:44:17.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那块木头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now there's some wood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.57,0:44:21.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我拉起来的时候你把它塞进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now when I lift this you wedge it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.36,0:44:24.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快点 女人 按我说的做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on woman,do as I tell you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.97,0:44:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.65,0:44:37.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再加一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.68,0:44:46.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再来一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that one over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.10,0:44:55.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这块木头上有轻微的凹痕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a slight indentation on this log.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.02,0:44:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这块也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.08,0:45:01.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由石板的重量造成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caused by the weight of the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.30,0:45:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对女士来说是个重活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavy work for a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.00,0:45:08.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而这个 我认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this,I think,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.71,0:45:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为最后的支撑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been used finally as a support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.06,0:45:26.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是我们的宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's our treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.64,0:45:29.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那箱子已经在这200多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That box is laying there for two centuries or more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.22,0:45:30.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要偷了它吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you steal it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.95,0:45:33.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人知其存在的东西 怎么偷？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you steal what nobody knows exists?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.21,0:45:34.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你是怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well how did you know then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.92,0:45:36.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}靠智慧 姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brains my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.65,0:45:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}历史和数学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}History and mathematics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.26,0:45:43.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来 帮我举着灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here,hold the light for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.41,0:46:01.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把灯举近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the light closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.66,0:46:15.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赚大钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make a fortune!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.58,0:46:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是啊 真有赚头啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes,that's a fine profit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.92,0:46:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.18,0:46:23.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里肯定有点价值的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be some value in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.41,0:46:26.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真聪明啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh how clever are you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.12,0:46:28.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该叫自负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A pride more like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.48,0:46:30.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比自己的主人博学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Known better than your masters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.81,0:46:32.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安静点 女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.27,0:46:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你所谓的聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your cleverness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.59,0:46:37.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}丈夫 你只想利用我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Husband,you just needed me to help you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.14,0:46:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果真有什么财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it had been treasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.63,0:46:40.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你早就把我甩得远远的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd of been over the way without me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.47,0:46:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会带着她走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would have gone with her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.39,0:46:46.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是个白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a fool if you believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.22,0:46:57.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.40,0:47:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帮我上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now help me out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.74,0:47:03.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.76,0:47:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.81,0:47:09.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的 找人帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My love,get help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.36,0:47:11.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我呼吸不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.07,0:47:15.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去找福尔摩斯先生 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Mr. Holmes,quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.86,0:47:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你了 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please,my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.36,0:47:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.76,0:47:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊 救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh God,help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.89,0:47:25.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.04,0:47:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.96,0:47:29.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.76,0:47:32.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.44,0:47:33.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.93,0:47:35.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.78,0:47:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋 救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel,help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.48,0:47:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就能解释她第二天早餐时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will explain her blanched face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.88,0:47:58.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苍白的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and her fevered brain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.41,0:48:00.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和低烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at breakfast the next morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.65,0:48:05.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有些菌类植物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing but fungi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.95,0:48:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}箱子里有什么 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what was in the box,Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.90,0:48:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查理一世国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Charles the First.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.88,0:48:26.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许能找到查理一世的其他物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may find something else of Charles the First.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.84,0:48:33.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}湖里钓上来的袋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bag that was fished from the mere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.44,0:48:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.10,0:48:41.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.79,0:48:43.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}传家宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A family heirloom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.01,0:48:45.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.54,0:48:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的祖先拉夫·马斯格雷夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're ancestor,Sir Ralph Musgrave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.31,0:48:50.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是位杰出的保皇党党员吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was he a prominent cavalier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.20,0:48:51.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.69,0:48:53.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 共和国时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes he was close to Charles the Second{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.40,0:48:56.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他与被放逐的查理二世十分亲密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in his wanderings during the Commonwealth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.14,0:48:58.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这构成我们所需信息的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I think that should give us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.51,0:49:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后一环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last link that we wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.42,0:49:06.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 你们必须知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,you must bear mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.85,0:49:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当皇室成员被流放时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the royal party were driven into exile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.46,0:49:10.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多会将其\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they probably left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.92,0:49:13.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}许多珍贵的财物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}many of their most precious possessions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.80,0:49:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埋藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}buried behind them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.51,0:49:16.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以备在和平时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the intention of returning for them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.96,0:49:20.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们回归故土时使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a more peaceful time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.09,0:49:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黄金 马斯格雷夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gold,Musgrave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.67,0:49:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你手中的碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson I believe you have in your hand a relic,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.33,0:49:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不仅其本身价值很高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is not only of great intrinsic value,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.70,0:49:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其历史价值亦不相伯仲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but also great importance as a historical curiosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.48,0:49:37.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.61,0:49:42.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一块碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing less than a fragment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.83,0:49:46.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}属于古英格兰国王皇冠的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the ancient crown of the kings of England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.86,0:49:48.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇冠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crown!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.91,0:49:50.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no,no,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.40,0:49:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这太不切实际了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too amiable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.13,0:50:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回想一下礼典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now consider the ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.83,0:50:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是怎么说的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does it run?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.75,0:50:05.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它是谁的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.45,0:50:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个离开的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His who is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.99,0:50:10.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是指被处死的查理一世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the execution of Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.56,0:50:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接着是"谁应拥有它？"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then who shall have it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.97,0:50:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个将到来的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He who will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.41,0:50:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是指查理二世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was Charles the Second,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.60,0:50:21.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其归来已经预见到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose advent was already foreseen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.90,0:50:24.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想 毫无疑问 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There can,I think,be no doubt,gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.50,0:50:28.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个破碎得不成型的皇冠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that this battered and shapeless diadem{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.34,0:50:31.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾经属于斯图亚特王朝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once encircle the brows of the royal Stuart's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.14,0:50:35.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那怎么会出现在我家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how came it into my family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.38,0:50:37.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当查理一世被处决时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Charles the First was executed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.06,0:50:39.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇冠被抢走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the crown was seized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.01,0:50:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摔成碎片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broken into pieces{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.02,0:50:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}高价卖出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sold for a thousand guineas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.06,0:51:07.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至此下落不明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since then there has been no trace of it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.57,0:51:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直至现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.55,0:51:12.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么查理二世回来时不拿走？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why did Charles not get it back on his return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.20,0:51:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个问题 也许永远不会有答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a question,which may never be answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.39,0:51:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的祖先去世时 由于疏忽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you ancestor died by some oversight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.36,0:51:24.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将这个指引留给其子孙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he left this guide to his descendent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.22,0:51:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而没对其内容做任何解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without ever explaining the meaning of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.63,0:51:30.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世代相传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father to son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.41,0:51:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直至落入一名男子手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until at last it came within reach{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.33,0:51:39.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将谜团解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a man who tore it's secret out of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.55,0:51:44.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并丧命于这场冒险中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lost his life in the venture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.59,0:51:46.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.71,0:51:55.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞秋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rachel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.56,0:51:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}木棍真的是自行滑落吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it chance that the wood slipped{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.30,0:52:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的罪仅在于没有呼救吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was she only guilty of silence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.08,0:52:04.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她有着容易激动的凯尔特人脾性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had a passionate,Celtic soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.41,0:52:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个男人负了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man had wronged her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.80,0:52:07.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可以决定其生死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had it in her power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.29,0:52:09.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是为了复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might it rather been vengeance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.97,0:52:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而将石板盖上吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that sent the stone crashing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.33,0:52:15.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用她的双手把木棍抽走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her hand that dashed it away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.29,0:52:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她现在在哪里呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what has become of her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.75,0:52:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能已经带着她的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very probably she's far away from Hurlstone now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.44,0:52:24.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}远走高飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and carries her secret with her.{\r}
